    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "title",
     "text": "Garcia Hand Picked Pop-Up",
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "datetime",
     "text": "August 14, 2026\n@ 4:00 pm\n- 6:00 pm"
    },
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/6dbdd385-Garcia_Hand_Picked_logo_200px.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Garcia_Hand_Picked_logo_200px.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Garcia Hand Picked",
     "w": 200,
     "h": 193,
     "kind": "event-image"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Learn more about Garcia Hand Picked products, their mission and who they are!"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "THEIR STORY"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Given a blank space to create a cannabis brand worthy of Jerry, we picked everything carefully. We took an eco-friendly path whenever possible, sourced original and unique genetics with stories of their own, and partnered with expert and honorable people to cultivate, roll joints, and make sure everything is of the highest quality. We spent a lot of time looking for the right partners to ensure our weed is worth sharing. Our traveling Airstream, Bertha, continues to crisscross the country spreading her magic and bliss. She’s filled with merch and music and has become a beloved ambassador of Garcia Hand Picked.</p><p>Set intention for a good time, pick a favorite show, and share with your tribe what thousands of fans have already discovered: the transcendent experience of cannabis and music. Expand your mind and remember that life is yours to explore and enjoy.</p><p>Jerry was a musician, an artist, a legend, and for sure, someone who opted for fun in his lifetime. That is our hope for you. Take a moment to reconnect with everything that is beautiful, right, and good, and above all else, don’t forget to have fun!</p><p>With gratitude from our family to yours,<br> The Garcia Family</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Hand-Picked Cannabis Worthy of a Legend."
    },
    {
     "t": "embed",
     "kind": "video",
     "src": "https://capecodcannabis.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GHP_Spinning_Cultivars.mp4?_=1",
     "settings": {
      "controls": "controls"
     }
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "CLASSIC FLOWER"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Inspired by old-school lot strains, Garcia Hand Picked cultivars like Florida Kush and LA Baker are becoming big hits with cannabis lovers.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "JERRY’S PICKS"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Modeled after Jerry’s guitar picks, Jerry’s Picks are tasty, all-natural, and terpene infused for a natural effect. With blueberry, raspberry, blackberry and 10 mg of THC artfully blended together, fun is highly likely.</p>",
     "overflow": true
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "DOUBLE DOOBIE"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Imagine two joints where you thought there might be one, introducing Double Doobie. Same cultivars you’ve come to love, now in a two-half gram joint package. More joints, more bridges.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "ROADIE PACK"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Ten packs of quality pre-rolled joints are now available in ecofriendly packs made for passing and sharing.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "TOUR PACK"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>The Garcia Hand Picked Tour Pack was made for life on tour in an easy to pack, easy to share resealable bag.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Click here to shop Garcia Hand Picked products!",
     "href": "/brands/garcia-hand-picked/"
    },
